t=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643290/extras/378d1fc48aaef1f864384123357ebd0f.webm?t=1765444092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643290/extras/378d1fc48aaef1f864384123357ebd0f.mp4?t=1765444092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from bonking your friends and dive into the single-player time trials mode. Push your skills to the limit, earn shiny stars, and climb to the top of the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643290/extras/72b4771a291023b9e34d6d77153a843f.poster.avif?t=1765444092\" width=600 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643290/extras/72b4771a291023b9e34d6d77153a843f.webm?t=1765444092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643290/extras/72b4771a291023b9e34d6d77153a843f.mp4?t=1765444092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attach an Oblinterator to the Sticky Rocket and watch absolute chaos unfold, or punch a rocket in midair and see it reverse back at its original shooter. Get creative and bend the emergent mayhem in your favor to stand victorious. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643290/extras/935fb974269e0579aea4bb7a6dc21805.poster.avif?t=1765444092\" width=600 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643290/extras/935fb974269e0579aea4bb7a6dc21805