d destroy friendships in this physics-based couch/online fighting game. Use your elastic arms to swing, slingshot, and parkour around the highly dynamic maps. Wield powerful weapons or use your bare fists to bonk your opponents!","steam_appid":2643290,"support_info":{"email":"contact@minmax.gg","url":"https://discord.gg/2wpGqcfKkt"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Spain, Turkish","type":"game","website":"https://oblin.party"}